BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Calm and Colour - featuring a therapy dog
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260927T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260927T160000
UID:6a3d88bcf3bd131b675ff07b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For adults seeking a soothing\, mindful escape from the stress
 es of daily life.\nWhether you're looking to unwind after a long day\, boo
 st your creativity\, or simply find a peaceful moment for yourself\, come 
 to our tranquil space for a coloring activity and to recharge.\nEach sessi
 on will feature special guests:\na therapy dog\nand\nhandler team\nfrom On
 e Health Partners. Participants will be invited to gently interact with th
 e dog in small groups of up to 5 people at a time.\nFeel free to bring you
 r own coloring materials!\nRegistrants will need to check-in by 3:05 pm to
  hold their spot. Drop-ins welcome until capacity is reached.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 101\, ground floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3d88bcf3bd131b675ff07b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
