 and Chat.\nCraft and socialize in a friendly and welcoming environment. Un
 leash your talent\, express your creativity\, and make new friends.\nJoin 
 us twice a month for a fun hour of creativity. All skill levels welcome.\n
 A limited supply of materials will be available\, so please bring your own
  supplies and a small project\, if you have them.\nLimited instruction ava
 ilable for beginners in cross-stitch.\nDrop in\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Spadina Road\, Centre of room at Canoe Table
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a09f178b29ea2800d2af56
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
